			"notes": "- Fixed an issue causing the Alpha Boss to attack at an unintended frequency during the Alpha Trial in Minecraft 26.1.2.\n- Fixed unexpected fire application behavior with Flame Claws.\n- Updated item textures to a consistent 16×16 resolution.\n- Improved Auto Step behavior. Auto Step can now be enabled or disabled in the configuration file (enabled by default).All three werewolf forms can automatically step over obstacles between 1 and 2 blocks high, depending on the form."
		},
